{"id":"2ad3e401f85da77f","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-pbenvelopes.md","title":"Barycentric convex and concave envelopes","display":"df-pbenvelopes — Barycentric convex and concave envelopes","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-pbenvelopes","aliases":["27-df-pbenvelopes"],"display":"df-pbenvelopes — Barycentric convex and concave envelopes","depends_on":["[[27-df-pbextension]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§13.3.2","source_statement":"Concave envelope and dual convex envelope; finite barycentric construction","source_printed_pages":"581","source_pdf_pages":"605","verification_status":"local-construction-of-source-object"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-pbenvelopes"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-pbenvelopes</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pbenvelopes — Barycentric convex and concave envelopes"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"53f1b3025ce14af2\" href=\"?note=53f1b3025ce14af2\" title=\"27-df-pbextension\">27-df-pbextension</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§13.3.2"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"Concave envelope and dual convex envelope; finite barycentric construction"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"581"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"605"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-construction-of-source-object"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in U_n\">\\(p\\in U_n\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"53f1b3025ce14af2\" href=\"?note=53f1b3025ce14af2\" title=\"27-df-pbextension\">27-df-pbextension</a>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\(N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>待定义包络记号：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LowEnv},\\mathrm{UpEnv}\">\\(\\mathrm{LowEnv},\\mathrm{UpEnv}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda_n(p)\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\lambda\\in[0,1]^{\\mathbb B^n}:\\sum_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}\\lambda(a)=1\\;\\land\\;\\forall i\\in N\\;\\left(\\sum_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}\\lambda(a)a_i=p_i\\right)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Lambda_n(p)\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\lambda\\in[0,1]^{\\mathbb B^n}:\\sum_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}\\lambda(a)=1\\;\\land\\;\\forall i\\in N\\;\\left(\\sum_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}\\lambda(a)a_i=p_i\\right)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LowEnv}(f):U_n\\to\\mathbb R,\\qquad\\mathrm{LowEnv}(f)(p)\\coloneqq\\min_{\\lambda\\in\\Lambda_n(p)}\\sum_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}\\lambda(a)f(a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LowEnv}(f):U_n\\to\\mathbb R,\\qquad\\mathrm{LowEnv}(f)(p)\\coloneqq\\min_{\\lambda\\in\\Lambda_n(p)}\\sum_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}\\lambda(a)f(a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UpEnv}(f):U_n\\to\\mathbb R,\\qquad\\mathrm{UpEnv}(f)(p)\\coloneqq\\max_{\\lambda\\in\\Lambda_n(p)}\\sum_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}\\lambda(a)f(a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{UpEnv}(f):U_n\\to\\mathbb R,\\qquad\\mathrm{UpEnv}(f)(p)\\coloneqq\\max_{\\lambda\\in\\Lambda_n(p)}\\sum_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}\\lambda(a)f(a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书称最小凹扩张为 concave envelope。这里用有限重心可行域构造 UpEnv，并同时构造最大凸扩张 LowEnv；与原书对应关系由下游定理证明。Λ非空：可取独立 Bernoulli 质量，也可按坐标排序取链顶点重心；有限维闭有界集合保证紧，线性目标两端可取到，所以两个定义均单值良定义。独立分布只是一种可行分布，包络还允许相关分布。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pbextension","status":"resolved","id":"53f1b3025ce14af2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbextension]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbextension","status":"resolved","id":"53f1b3025ce14af2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$，$p\\in U_n$（see [[27-df-pbextension]]），$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in U_n","display":false},{"tex":"N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LowEnv},\\mathrm{UpEnv}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Lambda_n(p)\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\lambda\\in[0,1]^{\\mathbb B^n}:\\sum_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}\\lambda(a)=1\\;\\land\\;\\forall i\\in N\\;\\left(\\sum_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}\\lambda(a)a_i=p_i\\right)\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LowEnv}(f):U_n\\to\\mathbb R,\\qquad\\mathrm{LowEnv}(f)(p)\\coloneqq\\min_{\\lambda\\in\\Lambda_n(p)}\\sum_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}\\lambda(a)f(a).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UpEnv}(f):U_n\\to\\mathbb R,\\qquad\\mathrm{UpEnv}(f)(p)\\coloneqq\\max_{\\lambda\\in\\Lambda_n(p)}\\sum_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}\\lambda(a)f(a).","display":true}],"bytes":1938,"backlinks":[{"id":"7ca316f0d7623463","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"取 $n=2$；$\\mathrm{PolExt},\\mathrm{LovExt}$（see [[27-df-lovaszextension]]），$\\mathrm{LowEnv},\\mathrm{UpEnv}$（see [[27-df-pbenvelopes]]）。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-283","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-pbenvelopes|df-pbenvelopes — Barycentric convex and concave envelopes]]"},{"id":"5720cafbff146a93","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$；$\\mathrm{LowEnv},\\mathrm{UpEnv},\\Lambda_n$（see [[27-df-pbenvelopes]]），$\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f),\\mathrm{Convex}_n,\\mathrm{Concave}_n,U_n$ 经该定义的直接上游。"}],"outgoing":["53f1b3025ce14af2"]}